// The machine's inference meter, in the corner of the screen.
//
// Merge the block below into ~/.config/waybar/config.jsonc (and add
// "custom/ai" to one of the modules-left/center/right arrays). It polls
// `aidctl meter --waybar`, which asks the daemon over D-Bus — so it shows
// tokens per rolling day across every app and agent on the machine, named,
// with money beside them once a remote provider has a price table. The
// tooltip breaks it down per identity.
//
// The user running waybar must be in the `ai` group, like any other caller.
//
// "custom/ai": {
//     "exec": "aidctl meter --waybar",
//     "return-type": "json",
//     "interval": 30,
//     "format": "ai {}",
//     "tooltip": true
// }
